      <species id="mw0e44cd9c_d37d_4fd4_b4d0_8201e460d534" name="Mac_M2" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Number of M2 macrophage in the tumor compartment</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwbb88bbbe_a6c0_4587_9a20_48c8ae47413e" name="IL12" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Concentration of IL-12 in tumor</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw4517b005_97d7_4b59_b355_7245a71c3f3e" name="IL10" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Concentration of IL-10 in tumor</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw8ce20c26_9809_40e3_9dd7_01440e1c9bb6" name="qPSC" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Quiescent pancreatic stellate cells in tumor compartment. In normal pancreas, PSCs store vitamin A and maintain stromal homeostasis.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwc389aac0_969d_44c4_8f93_550397c9b65c" name="iCAF" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Inflammatory cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete IL-6, CCL5 and CXCL12, driving MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, and CXCR4-mediated T-cell exclusion (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021). Driven by tumor-derived IL-1alpha; TGFb antagonizes via IL-1R1 repression.</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw7d63d6f6_8717_4940_adb3_14c4395c47f1" name="myCAF" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Myofibroblastic cancer-associated fibroblasts. Secrete ECM (collagen), TGFb, VEGF. Build desmoplastic barrier. Favored by TGFb signaling (Biffi 2019). (CXCL12 is iCAF-derived, not myCAF -- audit m2-A-ECM-01.)</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw4a18fb8a_e2ea_4374_ac90_97804f40e2f7" name="apCAF" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Antigen-presenting cancer-associated fibroblasts. Express MHC-II, present tumor antigen tolerogenically -&gt; Treg induction. Rarest subtype ~2-5% of CAFs (Elyada 2019).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mw9fffefb8_cdd1_4ce2_b0c0_89fd7c176392" name="collagen" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWBUILTINPREFIX_milli_MWBUILTINUNIT_gram" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Fibrillar collagen (types I/III) in tumor (total mass in mg). Primary structural ECM component driving desmoplasia. Determines pore size (immune exclusion) and stiffness (mechanotransduction).</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwfe56bff3_3643_4d84_b89f_e254b9871ea6" name="CXCL12" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CXCL12/SDF-1 chemokine secreted by iCAFs. Major T cell exclusion mechanism in PDAC via CXCR4 signaling (Elyada 2019, Ogawa 2021).</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwf93970f3_2e09_403b_b0b8_dcf345702afc" name="IL6" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-6 inflammatory cytokine secreted by iCAFs. Promotes MDSC recruitment, M2 polarization, tumor progression.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwcbbf2573_5986_4a60_9155_fae589793f68" name="IL1" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-1alpha in tumor compartment. Tumor-derived; drives iCAF formation via NF-kB/LIF/JAK-STAT3. TGFb antagonizes signaling by downregulating IL-1R1.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwc109df34_65c9_45cb_a62d_05b7d0dae682" name="NK" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Number of NK cells in the tumor compartment</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
      <species id="mwe3365f2f_71c3_4e59_a86a_ba5d57ab7293" name="XCL1" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mw167d5273_0372_4475_92fe_d30569ea7e16" name="CXCL9" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Concentration of CXCL9/10 (lumped CXCR3 ligands) in the tumor compartment</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
            <Unit Numerator="nanomolarity"/>
          </SimBiology>
        </annotation>
      </species>
      <species id="mwaa218878_7ea2_434c_96d3_448b6b29016c" name="CD8_TLA" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
