      <species id="mw5d429209_1b07_4116_827f_4871611ec940" name="CD8_vic" compartment="mw17b20b77_5482_4e77_94bb_38244168aa38" initialAmount="0" substanceUnits="MWUSERUNIT_cell" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="true" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Egressed activated effector CD8 in the neoplastic vicinity outside the TLA (Heumann Fig 5d 2-4% subset); higher per-cell killing quality (phi_vic_kill) and effector-memory-like durability (k_vic_decay) — the urelumab antitumor/survival effector pool</body>
        </notes>
      </species>
